WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.103
Open a lesson.

2
00:00:01.223 --> 00:00:04.520
Click Learn, choose Lessons, and open the first lesson.

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.553
The Sprout opening introduces the topic before the concepts appear.

4
00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:16.184
Work through the material.

5
00:00:16.304 --> 00:00:20.774
Click Next slide to see the example, then open the practice prompt and summary.

6
00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:23.216
Underlined words open definitions.

7
00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:25.434
Complete the quiz.

8
00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:28.537
Click Start quiz, choose an answer, and check it.

9
00:00:28.657 --> 00:00:30.538
Work through all five questions.

10
00:00:30.658 --> 00:00:33.561
At least four correct answers are needed to pass.

